{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons, long regarded as the tombs of elves and dwarves, the end of immortality, have brought forth crazed monsters, filthy short-lived natives, and the most deadly of all\u2014&quot;Dungeon Sickness.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That was until the arrival of one man: Emperor Arhan Lincoln, who single-handedly ended the Immortal War and ruled Middle-earth for centuries. On his deathbed, he declared:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Curious about the source of my wealth, power, and wisdom? Seek it in the dungeons. There lies endless fortune and supreme might\u2014I merely caught a lucky glimpse of a fraction of it.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world descended into madness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will take on the role of a filthy, short-lived native struggling in the dungeons. Accept quests from the immortal nobles, purge the dangers within the dungeons, claw out a chance at survival, and defy fate to rewrite your destiny!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Fight Monsters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966120/extras/5ae7e5a9acf6e4ac3a596938847190d9.avif?t=1758174735\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Collection\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966120/extras/f44b0e319abb34392c5a970475af98ec.avif?t=1758174735\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything is manageable!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966120/extras/c1724a45636fb36f299ddde8d3b334d2.avif?t=1758174735\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather labyrinth treasures to exchange for various powerful items and rare skins</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966120/extras/29d7f503547f3debc3b3635ca04b214c.avif?t=1758174735\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966120/extras/d16da05dcca9731ae4abec402624a124.avif?t=1758174735\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's go! Labyrinth!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966120?t=1758174735","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966120/3cc8b462eb0f22c4b52faaa0efece875e38e4ec9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758174735","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966120/d5e5ba5a4319851a35bb7b9f0b120d903c7cf91f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758174735","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966120/d5e5ba5a4319851a35bb7b9f0b120d903c7cf91f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758174735","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Cartoon Violence"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons, long regarded as